STRICT RESPONSE FORMAT:
- JSON
- "options" key with value as a list of 3 statements.
- "answer" key with value as a dictionary mapping each statement to "Yes"/"No" (or True/False).

Example:
```json
{
  "options": [
    "Statement 1 text...",
    "Statement 2 text...",
    "Statement 3 text..."
  ],
  "answer": {
    "Statement 1 text...": "Yes",
    "Statement 2 text...": "No",
    "Statement 3 text...": "Yes"
  }
}
```
